# Expo-first dependencies

Canonical policy: [docs/guides/expo-first-dependencies.md](../../docs/guides/expo-first-dependencies.md) (also linked from [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)).

## Quick rules

- Prefer **Expo-maintained** modules (`expo-*`) when Expo covers the need; install with **`npx expo install`**.
- **Navigation:** Expo Router (`src/routes/`). Do **not** add a second navigation library or direct `@react-navigation/*` app imports. Use `hrefs`, `useRouter`, and `useLocalSearchParams`; import navigation helpers only from `expo-router`, `expo-router/drawer`, or `expo-router/react-navigation`.
- After native/Expo bumps: `npm run doctor` (and `npx expo install --fix` only on a dedicated deps ticket / #422).
- Query **Expo MCP** before inventing APIs ([expo-mcp.mdc](./expo-mcp.mdc)). Android-only forever ([android-only.mdc](./android-only.mdc)).
